        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest case 111:\n\nf(A)=0f(A) = 0f(A)=0 for permutations {1,2,31,2,31,2,3}, {1,3,21,3,21,3,2}, {2,3,12,3,12,3,1}, {3,1,23,1,23,1,2}, {3,2,13,2,13,2,1} .\nf(A)=1f(A) = 1f(A)=1 for permutation {2,1,32,1,32,1,3}.\n\n\n\nTherefore ∑f(P)=1\\sum f(P) = 1∑f(P)=1.\n\n\nTest case 222:\n\nf(A)=1f(A) = 1f(A)=1 for permutations {3,1,2,43,1,2,43,1,2,4} and {3,2,1,43,2,1,43,2,1,4}.\nf(A)=0f(A) = 0f(A)=0 for all other permutations.\n\n\n\nTherefore ∑f(A)=2\\sum f(A) = 2∑f(A)=2."
